00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.250
Because YouTube does have a process for disputing
these claims.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:47.360
The way it's supposed to work is once you
say, no, I don't agree with this claim, I'm

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.720
