period only starts when I filed the dispute.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.180
We were away all of week.

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:11.970
These are videos still getting a numerous
views.

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:16.750
We're a full week goes by before I got home
and filed the dispute that money's gone no

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.230
