00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:22.500
Number two, YouTube is not really adjudicating
the dispute.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:29.240
When I file a dispute, CNN or Univision or
whoever gets 30 days to say, you know what,

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:35.110
David was right or no, we don't think David
was right and after that, I don't know that

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.310
there is any further recourse that I have.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:41.610
If they say we're keeping the dispute going,
they can simply say David's wrong and they

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.610
