00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:18.950
The system is broken.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:23.980
The system is crushing us merely by making
me have to deal with this.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.960
This is a common tactic.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:31.070
Uh, when you get a law firm representing a
large corporation and they're what they want

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:37.070
to go after a small business or an individual,
one of the ways that they gum up the system

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:43.620
is sending endless discovery requests, requests
for documents, filing, uh, all sorts of different

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:49.310
motions that the small business or the individual
either become overwhelmed with by having to

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:56.330
